!!! oculus/input/event.mat
!!! Input event primitives.
!!!
!!! All input arrives as typed events. These are the atomic
!!! primitives the compositor receives from the kernel.

book oculus.input.event

read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! A keyboard input event.

public keyboard-event begin record
    field key-code as override long
    field is-pressed as boolean
    field timestamp as override long
end record

!!! A pointer input event.

public pointer-event begin record
    field position as point
    field button-mask as override long
    field is-moved as boolean
    field timestamp as override long
end record
